// Standalone compilation unit for shared triangle-soup GPU facilities.
//
// Boolean also includes the same .ush because its classification and ray passes
// consume the generated topology/field. Keeping this file standalone lets other
// C++ producers dispatch the common kernels without depending on a Boolean shader.

